sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Srv as Backend
    participant PI as Play Integrity (Google)

    User->>App: tap Pay
    App->>Srv: begin payment
    Srv-->>App: nonce N
    App->>PI: requestIntegrityToken(nonce = N)
    PI-->>App: signed integrity token T
    App->>Srv: submit payment + T
    Srv->>Srv: verify T (signature, nonce == N, verdict)
    alt genuine app + device integrity
        Srv-->>App: payment allowed
    else degraded / tampered
        Srv-->>App: require step-up (Ch 21) or block
    end
